WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:06.358
Objects lists every object of every system, so you can find the one to open.

2
00:00:06.358 --> 00:00:11.620
One sentence says which object holds the most back.

3
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:16.853
The one button is the next step for your role.

4
00:00:16.853 --> 00:00:22.176
One table per system. The object with the lowest measured score comes first.

5
00:00:22.176 --> 00:00:29.473
Each row shows the score out of 100, the trend, open findings, records at risk and the latest run.

6
00:00:29.473 --> 00:00:35.344
Open Material master to see the object.

7
00:00:35.344 --> 00:00:43.332
The run picker sets which run you read. The run stays in the address, so a link shows the same run.
